Publishing team,

Approved to publish KI-1054, Notification lag, with the reviewed wording.

Please retain the scope: email and in-app notices can arrive after the ticket
event, while the activity feed remains the latest visible state. The published
workaround should direct readers to check the activity feed before repeating an
action solely because a notice is delayed. Do not present the validation work as
a general service-resolution statement.

After publication, send the standard internal notice and link the article from
the known-issues index.

